    <string name="agree_and_continue">Agree and continue</string>
    <string name="from_phonemail">from PhoneMail</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">PhoneMail stores your phone number, your profile (name, about and photo) and the emails you send and receive so the service can work.\n\nIf you allow it, the app reads your contacts only to show names in chats and to find friends who already use PhoneMail. Contacts are not stored on our servers.\n\nIf you allow it, the app reads the verification SMS to fill in the code for you.\n\nWe never sell your data. You can delete your account at any time from Settings.</string>
    <string name="terms_text">PhoneMail gives every phone number an email address such as 9876543210@phonemail.com.\n\n• You verify that the number is yours with a one-time password sent by SMS.\n• Don\'t use PhoneMail for spam, malware, fraud or illegal content, and don\'t impersonate other people.\n• If you don\'t use the app, we can alert you about new email by SMS. You can turn this off in the web settings.\n• You can delete your account at any time.\n\nPhoneMail is a demonstration project provided \"as is\", without warranties.</string>
